{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00772",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 2.35,
      "end_seconds": 14.62,
      "duration_seconds": 12.27,
      "text": "Hello doctor. I've got, um, my periods have gone irregular, and I'm getting hair on my chin and cheeks. I forget exactly when it began."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.3,
      "end_seconds": 23.8,
      "duration_seconds": 6.5,
      "text": "Let's take it one at a time. How are your periods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.7,
      "end_seconds": 33.93,
      "duration_seconds": 6.23,
      "text": "Every two or three months. Sometimes I skip. Before, they were regular."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.69,
      "end_seconds": 39.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "When did they change, roughly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.45,
      "end_seconds": 50.9,
      "duration_seconds": 7.45,
      "text": "I think two years ago? Or maybe three. I really can't tell."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.59,
      "end_seconds": 56.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.21,
      "text": "That's fine. And the hair?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 60.16,
      "end_seconds": 70.25,
      "duration_seconds": 10.09,
      "text": "Dark, coarse hairs on the chin, and some on my upper lip. I wax it every week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.02,
      "end_seconds": 78.3,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "Any acne, weight gain, or thinning on the scalp? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.35,
      "end_seconds": 89.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.82,
      "text": "Some spots on my jaw. And I've put on about five kilos. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 92.5,
      "end_seconds": 95.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.24,
      "text": "Are you on any medicine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.74,
      "end_seconds": 110.12,
      "duration_seconds": 11.38,
      "text": "Metformin, 500 mg, twice a day, which my last doctor gave me, and spironolactone, 50 mg, once a day, for the hair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 113.46,
      "end_seconds": 116.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "Good. Any allergies to medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.37,
      "end_seconds": 125.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.37,
      "text": "Penicillin. As a child, I had hives. I haven't taken it since."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.43,
      "end_seconds": 136.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "Thank you. Let me check your pulse and blood pressure. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 138.8,
      "end_seconds": 140.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "Okay. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.44,
      "end_seconds": 160.6,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "Pulse 74, blood pressure 118 over 74, weight 68 kilos."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.35,
      "end_seconds": 166.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "Is that normal? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 170.63,
      "end_seconds": 185.76,
      "duration_seconds": 15.13,
      "text": "Yes. The picture of irregular periods, excess hair and spots fits with something called polycystic ovary syndrome, but I'd like to confirm that with blood tests and a scan."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.45,
      "end_seconds": 192.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "PCOS? My cousin has it. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 196.66,
      "end_seconds": 205.73,
      "duration_seconds": 9.07,
      "text": "It's very common. I'd like to arrange blood tests for hormones, including testosterone, and a pelvic ultrasound."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.05,
      "end_seconds": 210.68,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "Okay. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.86,
      "end_seconds": 224.67,
      "duration_seconds": 9.81,
      "text": "The spironolactone can affect your periods and can harm a pregnancy, so are you using contraception? ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 227.25,
      "end_seconds": 229.35,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "Yes, condoms. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.11,
      "end_seconds": 242.14,
      "duration_seconds": 9.03,
      "text": "Keep doing that, please. I'd like you to continue the current tablets until we have the results. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 245.11,
      "end_seconds": 246.86,
      "duration_seconds": 1.75,
      "text": "Right. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.23,
      "end_seconds": 258.64,
      "duration_seconds": 8.41,
      "text": "Regular exercise and a balanced diet help a lot with this condition, even a small weight loss. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.65,
      "end_seconds": 263.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "I'll try. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.35,
      "end_seconds": 280.92,
      "duration_seconds": 14.57,
      "text": "If you miss a period and think you could be pregnant, take a test straight away and see me, because you must not take spironolactone in pregnancy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 284.05,
      "end_seconds": 286.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "I'll do that. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.22,
      "end_seconds": 299.99,
      "duration_seconds": 9.77,
      "text": "Or if the periods stop for more than six months, or you get heavy bleeding, come back to see me. ~"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.44,
      "end_seconds": 305.99,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Okay. Thank you. ~"
    }
  ]
}
